{"id":447,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Though infantile in appearance, it has the mysterious ability to read the minds of humans. The pure of heart are met with Riolu's approval, while those of ill nature earn only its loathing."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It can use waves called auras to gauge how others are feeling. These same waves can also tell this Pokémon about the state of the environment."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It’s exceedingly energetic, with enough stamina to keep running all through the night. Taking it for walks can be a challenging experience."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"It uses waves called auras to communicate with others of its kind. It doesn’t make any noise during this time, so its enemies can’t detect it."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It knows how people and Pokémon feel by looking at their auras. It doesn’t approach dangerous opponents."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"It’s tough enough to run right through the night, and it’s also a hard worker, but it’s still just a youngster."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"It can discern the physical and emotional states of people, Pokémon, and other natural things from the shape of their aura waves."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"The aura that emanates from its body intensifies to alert others if it is afraid or sad."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It uses the shapes of auras, which change according to emotion, to communicate with others."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It has the peculiar power of being able to see emotions such as joy and rage in the form of waves."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"They communicate with one another using their auras. They are able to run all through the night."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Its body is lithe yet powerful. It can crest three mountains and cross two canyons in one night."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Steadfast","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's determination boosts its Speed stat every time it flinches."},{"name":"Inner Focus","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's intense focus prevents it from flinching or being affected by Intimidate."},{"name":"Prankster","hidden":true,"description":"Gives priority to the Pokémon's status moves."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":null,"color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":447,"name":"Riolu","condition":null,"children":[{"id":448,"name":"Lucario","condition":"Level up, High Friendship (Day)","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,98],[1,203],[4,364],[8,232],[12,68],[16,526],[20,249],[24,410],[28,103],[32,501],[36,395],[40,14],[44,270],[48,383],[52,515],[56,179]],"machine":[332,97,280,339,523,370,811,242,91,409,89,203,263,374,411,264,270,8,67,490,232,417,398,182,244,240,156,179,157,317,421,214,164,241,129,14,36,851,9,885,918,410,428],"egg":[44,418,509,238,197,136,336],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv1-215","name":"Riolu","set":"Scarlet & Violet","date":"2023-03-31","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"215","artist":"Nelnal","img":"sv1/215"},{"id":"me2pt5-112","name":"Riolu","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"112","artist":"hncl","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-112/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-112/large"},{"id":"me1-76","name":"Riolu","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"76","artist":null,"img":"me1/76"},{"id":"sv8pt5-50","name":"Riolu","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","date":"2025-01-17","rarity":"Common","number":"50","artist":null,"img":"sv8pt5/50"},{"id":"sv7-81","name":"Riolu","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Common","number":"81","artist":null,"img":"sv7/81"},{"id":"sv4pt5-173","name":"Riolu","set":"Paldean Fates","date":"2024-01-26","rarity":"Shiny Rare","number":"173","artist":"sowsow","img":"sv4pt5/173"},{"id":"sv1-1